  "name": "icons",
  "api": 1,
  "title": "Icons",
  "description": "Drawn, single-color icons from a curated set of about 250 (Tabler, MIT, plus two of our own), written in inline code: `^{database, c3, lg}` on its own and `{S3, icon=bucket, c4}` inside a pill. They take the sparks' frame, look and corner axes and an `icon:` register. Cloud-provider neutral: no vendor logos; a service is a role icon beside its name. The drawings load only for a deck that writes an icon.",
